1
00:00:00,433 --> 00:00:02,769
The off-seasons of flower
shops are quite something.

2
00:00:02,769 --> 00:00:04,904
We're busy as hell
during the half of the year

3
00:00:04,904 --> 00:00:07,507
the other half feels eerily idle
like it's about to go under.

4
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:11,378
In times like these, I usually
focus on marketing strategies.

5
00:00:12,812 --> 00:00:15,215
Hye-won the one who's
really good at this.

6
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:17,684
How about Instagram Reels?

7
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:18,684
Reels?

8
00:00:18,985 --> 00:00:20,787
You're already doing
everything else.

9
00:00:21,554 --> 00:00:23,456
And Reels get you
a lot of views...

10
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:24,923
I think it'll work.

11
00:00:26,226 --> 00:00:28,495
There is one I took before.

12
00:00:28,495 --> 00:00:29,229
Do you want to see it?

13
00:00:29,429 --> 00:00:30,469
I haven't uploaded it yet.

14
00:00:37,837 --> 00:00:38,837
What do you think?

15
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:41,441
This is going to drive
all the customers away.

16
00:00:43,676 --> 00:00:46,079
But I can see that you tried.

17
00:00:46,813 --> 00:00:49,816
Fine, let's just focus on
what we've been doing.

18
00:00:51,618 --> 00:00:52,819
I can help.

19
00:00:54,921 --> 00:00:55,921
With the Reels.

20
00:00:56,189 --> 00:00:57,257
I can make them.
